{"id": "56852", "title": "青梅竹马有时尽", "author": "天下无猫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 23, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/56/56852.htm", "intro": "是本古代文，刚开始女主和自己的青梅竹马有JQ，看名字我还以为那青梅竹马才是楠竹，结果发现后来居上的夏皇子才是，本来嘛，这皇子也只是逗着女主玩，结果发现自己爱上女主了，不管女主心里有没有他，就强上了，女主前半部分一直爱着自己的青梅竹马，那什么，得不到才是最好的嘛，后来被楠竹XO多了，再加上，楠竹也确实宠她宠到不行，最后爱上了楠竹，后来还因为楠竹和别的妹子说话而吃醋了，这文肉多鲜美，而且还是宠文，强烈推荐", "base": "files/article/html/56/56852", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8002894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-9", "file": "8002900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10-13", "file": "8002903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-18", "file": "8002905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-23", "file": "8002907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-29", "file": "8002910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-35", "file": "8002913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8002915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "8002918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "8002920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "8002923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "8002924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "8002928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "8002929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "8002933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "8002937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "8002938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "8002939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "8002943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "8002945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "8002947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-110", "file": "8002949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-112", "file": "8002950.html", "available": false}]}